# The container image's Python dependencies (#342): pywrkr's own requirements
# plus those of the extras the image ships (#340). Kept in step with
# pyproject.toml by tests/test_docker_pinned_deps.py.
#
# extras: http2, otel, tui, yaml
#
# Compiled to requirements-image.txt, pinned by version and hash, for the
# image's interpreter (python:3.13-alpine, musl). Dependabot's uv updater
# re-runs the compile when a pin moves. Regenerate by hand with:
#   uv pip compile requirements-image.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.13 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-musl -o requirements-image.txt
